- Derived names must be clearly identified as inferred.
- Users should be able to correct inferred names.
- Both-field submissions must preserve user input appropriately.
- Empty and malformed submissions must receive useful validation messages.

Distinguish successful intake from successful investigation.

Do not claim an investigation occurred if the application merely accepted the name and requested a documentation URL.

